wn shortcomings before STing anything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-30T20:00:42-08:00","id":1024607,"title":"","content":"As someone who's been looking to get into a NWOD game for a while now (Mage particularly, but I'd be up for a crossover romp) I'd like to throw my own hat onto this pile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12814-epicjester","name":"Epicjester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-31T11:47:58-08:00","id":1024861,"title":"","content":"Sweet, as ST or as a Player? I only ask because I might be joining another game as a player and while I can play two PbP games I think STing and being a Player would be too much for me to handle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-01T04:25:31-08:00","id":1025048,"title":"","content":"A player. Since I've yet to actually be in a NWOD game yet, I'd rather play a bit first before I actually attempt to ST.","signature":"","edited":{