ew like Hunter Vigil or especially Mummy Curse and other stuff like roll20 or skype, though I'd have to see how I felt about voice/video. Never done that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12808,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12808-dissapatideum","user":"DissapatiDeum","date":". 01-03-2017, 08:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12808-dissapatideum","name":"DissapatiDeum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T17:53:50-08:00","id":1026246,"title":"","content":"Glad to hear you're interested. My only problem is that I can only access the internet with my smart phone so PbP is really my only viable option at the moment to game online. If you're willing to try PbP then I'm down to ST a Mage game with either elements or full blown crossover with Hunter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T18:30:53-08:00","id":1026254,"title":"","content":"No problemo. PbP is fine, I'm just a bit intimidated about figuring it out. Looks kinda complicated from what I've read on the boards. Ha would that mean that either other players or NPCs would be hunting us if we play mages? Neat. That would certainly be a challenge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12808-dissapatideum","name":"DissapatiDeum","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-03T18:42:29-08:00","id":1026259,"title":"","content":"Well, the beauty of Mage and Hunter is that they complement eachother very well in terms of politics and themes. They're both games about occult conspiracies, they're both about investigating the strangeness of the Chronicles of Darkness, and they're both about obsession and hubris in the face of powers that are beyond mortal comprehension. Plus, there's no reason Sleepwalkers can't be witch hunters. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T08:56:04-08:00","id":1027060,"title":"","content":"I'm interested in playing this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T12:11:23-08:00","id":1027205,"title":"","content":"Alright, that makes a group of about three. Those still interested please sound off and I can make a proper OOC thread for the nascent game. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> @Epicjester<br /> <br /> @DissapatiDeum<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Polish 01-05-2017, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T16:22:59-08:00","id":1027345,"title":"","content":"I'm interesting in playing mage if there is still a player slot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-05T18:42:50-08:00","id":1027374,"title":"","content":"Sure is Basic, that brings the potential player base to 4. Still need confirmations from some of the earlier posters though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T04:06:57-08:00","id":1027523,"title":"","content":"I could try a Mage. What traits are advisable for someone Obsessing over particle physics and how Magic interacts with it? So I can perform experiment, and then Scrutinize them with Forces and Matter Sight?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T12:50:54-08:00","id":1027807,"title":"","content":"Well, really if you can explain it in a rational way that fits your character you could potentially use any set of skills. As for the rules of Scrutiny itself I'd have to look it up in the 2E Mage book. Also, since I know Basic is reliable and you've posted twice I'm going to reveal the Chronicle idea I've been cooking up, so character creation parameters will be established. And that Chronicle is...<br /> <br /> The Curious Case of Gloria Margaret Calloway. A Crossover Chronicle for Mage the Awakening &amp; Hunter the Vigil.<br /> <br /> Setting: Langley Falls, a fictional New England Town.<br /> <br /> Theme: Locked Doors &amp; Buried Secrets.<br /> <br /> Mood: Deep Waters<br /> <br /> Synopsis: Langley Falls may be the closest thing to heaven on earth for some people. Sure the winters are cold, but the summers are pleasant while spring and fall is beautiful. The fishing industry may be a relic of a bygone era but the tourism industry is alive and well in such a verdant and secluded town. The people are nice and friendly to those who are new, and are eager to welcome new commerce to the city. And it's long time natives cultivate hidden societies and family secrets that span generations and become facets of a hidden community all their own. And most importantly, Langley Falls is a place that has seen few tragedies. To the natives, bad things happen elsewhere. And that's exactly how they like it. Or, at least bad things happen elsewhere until now. Gloria Calloway, the mayors daughter, has been murdered. The community is in a panic, both humble citizens and hidden societies are in an uproar, and those who knew her best start having strange dreams about a shrouded figure beneath the sea. <br /> <br /> Setup: One method I wanted to try to help ensure the success of this project is to actually have our group build the fictional city of Langley Falls from the ground up. Each player can contribute as much as they want to the setting, adding locations and people, and even mysteries. The catch, being that for every facet of the city that's added I'll add a secret for the players to discover. That way the city will be intimately familiar to everyone since you all made it, but it's secrets will still be obfuscated for your enjoyment to uncover. As mentioned, this is potentially both a Mage and Hunter story. If it swings more one way than another than that aspect we'll focus on more, but elements from both games will be present regardless. I hope this is acceptable to everyone's standards? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> P.S. Almost forgot, this is going to be a 2nd Edition CofD game regardless of it's focus. And, the character creation parameters is simply that Gloria Carter's death has profoundly affected you in some way. It could be because you're a family member or friend, it could be because you're part of the investigation to uncover her murderer, or perhaps another reason that I can't think up right now. The other thing as be it Mage or Hunter, this moment is what sets you on your path. For Mages this means Gloria's death or the strange dreams sets off your Awakening. If Hunter then either begins to eat away at you because you know something terrible is happening but can't fully explain why, and this will lead to you taking up the Vigil.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Spellcheck 01-06-2017, 04:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T13:46:44-08:00","id":1027831,"title":"","content":"Alright. Totally interested in this and I'll certainly help out. But I won't have time to until Sunday. I'll most likely be running a Magistos or a Moros","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12814-epicjester","name":"Epicjester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T16:23:11-08:00","id":1027906,"title":"","content":"I'd also ask that you add Kvark to the players list. He was sorta the one to make the topic after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12814-epicjester","name":"Epicjester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-06T16:35:24-08:00","id":1027912,"title":"","content":"Well, I'll be making a proper OOC for this soon. And it will probably take until the beginning of February to properly start. As for Kvark, they never responded and might have not even checked the Forums for some time. They're free to join if they'd like but right now what I need is confirmation. And so far that consists of Basic, Tambov, and yourself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T09:46:51-08:00","id":1028190,"title":"","content":"Would you want to do a crossover type game or anything?<br /> What Format were you thinking Dusk? I don't want to be a mage, but I would be happy with a Demon or a Vampire. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis","name":"Vitalis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2308_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"914"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T11:33:08-08:00","id":1028211,"title":"","content":"Where exactly in New England is Langley Falls located? In particular, how far from Boston?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T13:02:28-08:00","id":1028244,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2308-vitalis\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar2308_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2308\" data-vbnamecard=\"2308\">Vitalis</a>, Already set the peramaters for splats, the options are Mage and Hunter. I apologize if those peramaters aren't what you're hoping for but I have some very specific themes to explore through this Chronicle and adding more splats on top of that would just water down the soup. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a>, No sure yet, but since this is a collaberative setting it can be as close as you want so long as it's still along the coast. Hell, we could even change it to be in Massachusets if you want it to be closer still to Boston. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Polish 01-07-2017, 04:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T14:00:12-08:00","id":1028258,"title":"","content":"I'm definitly interest in playing a mage if you'd still have me. Seeing how the town is rather isolated and hasn't had many strange occurrences before I assume this would be a game for a nameless magician, where the order don't really play a role.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":5241,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","user":"Flinty","date":". 01-07-2017, 05:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T17:25:16-08:00","id":1028343,"title":"","content":"Well, we're still tallying in who's commuted to the project. But the target limit is 5 or 6 max. So far Epicjester, Tambov, and Basic are solid and awaiting more responses from some of the other earlier posters. But, right now you're definitely in the running. Although the game won't begin until early February.<br /> <br /> As for Orders, your right. Starting out all Mage players will be Nameless who very recently Awakened. The Orders do exist in Langley Falls, but they have a significantly lighter touch seeing how small and isolated it is. Same goes for Hunters. There are a few Compacts but only one Conspiracy present, and all will be hidden by the nascent Hunters as they first take up the Vigil. Induction into an Order, Compact, or Conspiracy would come later in the game and might be a possible ending for that Character. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T23:40:15-08:00","id":1028449,"title":"","content":"Speaking of which, what are the starting Arcana for Mages and starting Merits for Hunters?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T00:31:48-08:00","id":1028454,"title":"","content":"Mages and Hunters get Merits like any other 2E splat, 10 merits at character creation.<br /> <br /> Mage Arcana is also standard from the MtAw 2E core book. (Can't remember at the moment.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T04:55:30-08:00","id":1028504,"title":"","content":"You get a total of 6 dots. At least 1 needs to be in your Ruling Arcana. You cant start with any in your Inferior Arcana and you cant spend all your dots in Ruling at the start.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12814-epicjester","name":"Epicjester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T07:40:50-08:00","id":1028543,"title":"","content":"No.<br /> <br /> Charater creation: 6 dots, at least 3 in both Ruling, none may be in inferior, highest Arcanum at 3 @ Gnosis 1, rest may not exceed 2. Exemple: Moros, Death 1, Matter 3, Forces 2.<br /> <br /> Freshly Awakened: I distinctly remeber Dave saying freshly Awakened get Gnosis 1, 2 in one Ruling Arcanum, 1 in the other. Exemple: Moros, Death 1, Matter 2.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T09:13:44-08:00","id":1028575,"title":"","content":"A couple of questions :<br /> <br /> What else can you tell us about Gloria Calloway? How old was she? How was she murdered? A rough draft of her personality? This would help sorting out what kind of ties our characters could have had with her.<br /> <br /> What is your stance on legacies? I know our characters will be nameless and thus in all likelyhood have no access to a tutor, but a Daimonomikon (or a soul stone...) could be found. I don't have any specific legacy in mind yet, I merely like the flavour they add and wanted to know if that was a feasible aspiration or something that could be bought with Merit points at game start (the Daimonomikon, that is). In general what is your stance on buying an artifact with starting merit points? Any prohibited merits?<br /> <br /> Lastly: Any particular (exotic) abilities that someone in the party definitly should have for story reasons?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T12:09:51-08:00","id":1028639,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a>, didn't catch Dave's Freshky awakened option. I'm more than happy to use that to further immerse everyone in the beginning stages of Awakening. (Plus will be slightly more easier for me to manage as a ST)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"5241\" data-vbnamecard=\"5241\">Flinty</a>, Gloria was the youngest child of Lewis an Dianna Calloway. She was a bright child with a deep love of nature and her home town. She was 17 years old when she was murdered, and it came as a shock to the entire community. She was a straight A student, her dream was to become a teacher after college, had friends in all spheres of High School society, and as far as her friends were concern she had no known enemies. The crime scene of her murder is particularly curious because a) they haven't found it yet because a fisherman pulled her lifeless body from the bay and b) because there is no evidence of her ever leaving her home. As far as her family knows, they had dinner, she went to bed, and the next morning she was gone without a trance and turned up dead in the ocean with a bullet hole straight through her head. There is more to Gloria Calloway than that, but those secrets I'll wait to reveal until everyone has their relation to her. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> P.S. Since you've posted twice I'm locking your place in. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T13:59:33-08:00","id":1028680,"title":"","content":"Thanks <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I've been giving it a bit of thought and my current concept/relation to Gloria would be 'the chance encounter'. It's all still a rough draft, but I've been thinking of a boy who after highschool quickly dropped out of college and since then has been flitting from one job to the next, not really sure what to do with his life. He's not a local, but came to work in Langley Falls during the holiday season and met Gloria on a party. They hit it off and decided to meet up a few days later at the harbour (either as a date or with a couple of other friends, depends on Glorias personality). On the day of their meeting they fished Glorias corpse out of the bay just around the time they were supposed to meet.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T16:55:56-08:00","id":1028763,"title":"","content":"Nice! That sounds perfect. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T07:49:26-08:00","id":1029061,"title":"","content":"My own idea is that of the local Sheriff/Cop investigating the death itself and simply feeling that the whole thing seemed a bit off considering how well liked a girl Gloria was. His unwavering dedication to the case is what caused him to Awaken to the Watchtower of Stygia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12814-epicjester","name":"Epicjester","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T11:38:52-08:00","id":1029180,"title":"","content":"My idea is a student (a classmate of Gloria, if it works) overwhelmed by dreams of strange compounds in ever-shifting states, during which his curiousity causes him to Awaken to the Watchtower of the Leaden Coin, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow?p=925424#post925424\" target=\"_blank\">Simurgh</a>, Mysterium Thyrsus in Mountains of Shadow (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/939031-ic-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>|<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/924216-ooc-mage-the-awakening-2e-mountains-of-shadow\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov","name":"Tambov","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6508_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T11:59:39-08:00","id":1029189,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12814-epicjester\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12814\" data-vbnamecard=\"12814\">Epicjester</a>, yes! I was so hoping someone would choose the sheriff. ^_^<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6508-tambov\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar6508_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6508\" data-vbnamecard=\"6508\">Tambov</a>, most excellent. I'm glad we're getting a good range of perspectives here. <br /> <br /> Also, going to call it a Mage game since we have three Awakened concepts so far. There will still be elements from Hunter present, but the focus will be on the Awakened Community.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T12:55:49-08:00","id":1029211,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://app.roll20.net/campaigns/details/396444/city-of-night\" target=\"_blank\">https://app.roll20.net/campaigns/det.../city-of-night</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas","name":"Blue Thomas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4135_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T13:40:08-08:00","id":1029236,"title":"","content":"Uhm... <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4135-blue-thomas\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4135_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4135\" data-vbnamecard=\"4135\">Blue Thomas</a>, I think you might have posted a link on the wrong thread. :/","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T14:03:47-08:00","id":1029250,"title":"","content":"It actually fits the original thread. We should probably start an independent OOC thread for the upcoming game. Btw if it wasn't obvious I was going for an Acanthus awakening, though now I'm allmost tempted to witch to moros in order to make it an all moros game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1131211-flintys-homebrew-hub-2e\" target=\"_blank\">My Mage 2e Homebrew</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5241-flinty","name":"Flinty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"793"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T14:22:25-08:00","id":1029261,"title":"","content":"...right, sorry Blue Thomas. Let's take this to a more proper OOC. <br /> <br /> Also, I personally think playing an Acanthus would be cool but a full Moros game is something I've never seen before so it might be interesting. Ultimately it's up to you. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Edit: OOC is up in the Play by Post section. Still need some more confirmations and still have room for interested players.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":". 01-09-2017, 05:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T23:14:58-08:00","id":1029488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dusksage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1011135-player-looking-for-any-2e-game-via-just-about-any-format?p=1027374#post1027374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sure is Basic, that brings the potential player base to 4. Still need confirmations from some of the earlier posters though.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> So were will we do this PbP ?<br /> <br /> Can I start building the character now ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-10T01:05:22-08:00","id":1029497,"title":"","content":"Yes, but the game won't be starting until February. The above posts have the peramaters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T10:25:28-08:00","id":1032198,"title":"","content":"Hi, sorry! Approval for Onyx Path Forums took me like a week - slots still open? I've got a Silver Ladder or a Mysterium mage knocking about that I'd like to try on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T14:16:03-08:00","id":1032317,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12852_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12852\" data-vbnamecard=\"12852\">Silver_Smoulder</a>, I believe there's still room for a fifth slot (Atlantean sympathy anyone? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ) but be warned that this Chronicle will be a little different than the typical Mage Chronicle. Everyone will be playing freshly awakened Mages, and they'll all share a starting Obsession somehow related to the instigating event of the Chronicle. If you'd like to play in that kind of Chronicle than your welcome to join us in the PbP thread. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T20:08:20-08:00","id":1032443,"title":"","content":"Yeah, that sounds pretty interesting. So, no Orders yet then, or what?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12852-silver_smoulder","name":"Silver_Smoulder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12852_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"36"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-15T20:58:15-08:00","id":1032469,"title":"","content":"Would love to play here. I'm actually STing another mixed Chronicle on my city and haven't had the opportunity to actually play myself.<br /> If you have any slots, I'd like to bring Ignis, an Obrimos. As for connecting to Gloria, Ignis works at the local library and was wondering why Gloria suddenly stopped coming, until he learned that she died.<br /> As for Mystery Play Awakening, it has everything to do with the Library itself. He awoke to the Tower of Power in that same Library.<br /> All started with a weird dream. A recurring one of walking this weird golden road wreathed in flames. Never seeing where it leads, never seeing where it comes from, all covered in bright light. Before him only a haze, beckoning him. Skip a year from the beginning of these dreams and one day, as he was going to that Library to sign his contract as the new librarian, he suddenly felt a chill and his surroundings melting into pure gold, flames licking at his body, burning but not harming. Before him that same haze and golden road. All around him a chorus of Angels, judging him, humbling him with their piercing stare. An urge to run from them, he ran down the road of gold until he found refuge in a tower of pure light. He enters and before him yet another Angel, this one of Fire, glares at him, as if he could just see all the wrongs in him. Before him, one single sheet of paper, one tongue of flame. He grabs it. It sears his flesh. It sears his Hubris away. It illuminates and burns away all his doubts and his unwillingness to see beyond the Earthly. He signs his name, not on the paper, but on his very soul.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T03:43:08-08:00","id":1032575,"title":"","content":"Hey HTaiji,<br /> <br /> Love the concept and Mystery Play, unfortunatly I don't think I have the skill to manage a PbP above five players currently. If something was to change or there was to be an opening I'll let you know immediately.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3436,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","user":"Dusksage","date":".  Polish. 01-16-2017, 06:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-16T09:20:37-08:00","id":1032701,"title":"","content":"No prob, I understand :P CofD with more than 5 players stops working so smoothly after a while.<br /> Best of lucks!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}